**Repository Workflow:** Git / GitHub  

---

# Project Overview

**First Fantasy: The Dark Continent** is a text-based role-playing game being developed as a C++ console application.

The project serves two purposes:

1. Fulfill the requirements of the Programming 1 portfolio project.
2. Establish an early systems prototype for the larger First Fantasy game concept.

The console version focuses on building the underlying game systems before expanding those concepts into a graphical version of the game.

The current version, **v0.01**, establishes the core application framework, player character system, enemy system, and initial enemy bestiary.

