GetHP()
GetMaxHP()

GetAttack()
GetDefense()
```

---

# Enemy HP Setter

Enemy HP is controlled using:

```cpp
SetHP()
```

The setter prevents enemy HP from exceeding its valid range.

```text
If HP < 0
    HP = 0

Else if HP > Maximum HP
    HP = Maximum HP

Else
    HP = supplied value
```

Therefore:

```text
0 <= Enemy HP <= Enemy Maximum HP
```

This system establishes the basic functionality required for enemies to take damage during future combat.

