# Enemy Roles

Although v0.01 enemies currently use only basic statistics and attacks, their intended identities are:

### Venomous Snake

Early-game enemy intended to eventually introduce poison.

### Bat

Low-HP enemy intended to eventually emphasize speed or evasion.

### Hyena

Aggressive physical enemy intended for early wilderness encounters.

### Leopard

Stronger predator intended to represent a more dangerous wilderness encounter.

### Crocodile

High-defense enemy intended to encourage alternatives to basic physical attacks.

### Vampire Bat

Supernatural dungeon enemy intended to eventually use life-draining abilities.

### Bat Swarm

Group-style enemy intended to eventually introduce multi-hit or multi-target mechanics.

### Bonsam Thrall

Stronger humanoid enemy associated with the Bonsam.

### Bonsam

Intelligent supernatural enemy intended to use more advanced combat behavior.

### Bonsam Elder

Major boss encounter for the current adventure.

These special behaviors are **not implemented in v0.01**.

