# Current Combat Statistics

The current prototype uses four primary combat resources/statistics.

## HP

Represents a character or enemy's current health.

When HP reaches zero, the combatant will eventually be considered defeated.

## Ase

Ase is the resource used by playable characters for special abilities.

Ase abilities are planned but are not implemented in v0.01.

## Attack

Represents offensive physical power.

## Defense

Represents resistance to incoming physical damage.

---

# Planned Basic Damage Formula

The first combat prototype is planned to use:

```text
Damage = Attack - Defense
```

Damage will have a minimum value of:

```text
1
```

Conceptually:

```text
Calculate attacker Attack - defender Defense

If result < 1
    Damage = 1

Subtract Damage from defender HP
```

This system is planned for the combat prototype and is not part of the completed v0.01 framework.

