# Planned Console Redraw System

A future version of combat is planned to use a **clear/redraw approach**.

Instead of continuously printing new combat information down the console, the game will eventually:

```text
Player selects action
        |
        v
Resolve action
        |
        v
Update game state
        |
        v
Clear console
        |
        v
Redraw battle screen
```

This should allow the console application to behave more like a traditional JRPG interface.

The system will be implemented only after the basic combat loop is functional.

