# Development Philosophy

The project follows a simple development rule:

> First make it work, then make it better.

Systems are initially developed as small functional prototypes.

The development process follows:

```text
Design
  |
  v
Pseudocode
  |
  v
Basic Implementation
  |
  v
Compile
  |
  v
Test
  |
  v
Debug
  |
  v
Commit
  |
  v
Improve Later
```

Advanced mechanics and presentation features are deliberately postponed until their underlying systems work.

