# Source File Responsibilities

## `main.cpp`

Responsible for the primary application flow and connecting the Menu and Game systems.

## `Menu.h / Menu.cpp`

Responsible for menu screens, menu input, lore, credits, instructions, and exit confirmation.

## `Game.h / Game.cpp`

Responsible for starting and maintaining an active game session and holding the current player characters.

## `Character.h / Character.cpp`

Responsible for playable character data and basic character behavior.

## `Enemy.h / Enemy.cpp`

Responsible for enemy data and basic enemy behavior.

## `Bestiary.h / Bestiary.cpp`

Responsible for constructing the predefined enemies used by First Fantasy.

