# Project Goal

The immediate goal is to create a complete, functional C++ console RPG while demonstrating proper use of object-oriented programming and interacting game systems.

The longer-term purpose of the project is to prototype the gameplay systems and design concepts that can eventually form the foundation of a larger version of:

# First Fantasy: The Dark Continent
